What no licence here covers
---------------------------

src/, include/, assets/, Makefile, tools/, rsp/ and ld/ come from the GoldenEye
007 decompilation. That work describes a copyrighted game. Nothing in this
repository grants any right to GoldenEye 007 itself, which remains the property
of its owners.

No ROM, and no data extracted from a ROM, is distributed here or in any build
artifact. You must supply your own copy of the game.
